+     bar/backdrop) = 20..30; overlays (drawer/modal/palette/HUD) = 40..50; 60+
+     is reserved for critical confirmation only (cockpit kill-switch). Identity
+     migrations only in phase 1: tier 30 -> z-shell, tier 40 -> z-overlay, tier
+     50 -> z-modal (values preserved exactly). Ad-hoc z-[90]/[100]/[999]/[9999]
